  help: {
    overline: 'Help Center',
    title: 'How Can We Help You?',
    searchPlaceholder: 'Search questions...',
    catAll: 'All',
    catGetStarted: '馃殌 Getting Started',
    catStaking: '馃挵 Staking & Withdrawal',
    catNodes: '馃弳 Node Levels',
    catReferral: '馃懃 Referral Rewards',
    catSecurity: '馃敀 Security',
    catTrouble: '鈿狅笍 Troubleshooting',
    q1: 'What is RWA Protocol?',
    a1: 'RWA Protocol is a decentralized staking protocol on Binance Smart Chain (BSC). Users stake USDT to earn daily RWA token rewards, while the node level system unlocks referral bonuses. The protocol uses a 50/50 model: 50% to Treasury reserve, 50% to community rewards pool.',
    q2: 'How do I get started? What are the steps?',
    a2: '4 steps: 鈶?Download OKX or Binance App and create a Web3 wallet; 鈶?Deposit USDT (BEP-20) to your wallet; 鈶?Click \'Connect Wallet\' on this site; 鈶?Go to Stake page, enter amount and confirm. Minimum stake: 100 USDT.',
    q3: 'Which wallets are supported?',
    a3: 'Supports all BSC-compatible wallets: OKX Wallet, Binance Web3 Wallet, MetaMask, TokenPocket, and others via WalletConnect. Recommended: use OKX or Binance App\'s built-in browser for the smoothest experience.',
    q4: 'How is daily yield calculated?',
    a4: 'Daily yield = your staked USDT 脳 0.8%, converted to RWA tokens at that day\'s price. Example: stake 1,000 USDT, RWA at $0.85, you earn 1,000 脳 0.8% 梅 0.85 鈮?9.41 RWA daily. Rewards settle at UTC 00:00; arrival may have slight delay.',
    q5: 'What are the withdrawal limits?',
    a5: 'Withdrawal limits: 鈶?Unified minimum: 100; 鈶?RWA reward withdrawals still observe the 24-hour cooldown; 鈶?Immediate exits charge a flat 8% fee split into 3% buyback/burn, 3% treasury, and 2% community pool; 鈶?stRWA mode charges 0% fee and mints 120% as 30-day locked stRWA; 鈶?Gas still requires a small amount of BNB.',
    q6: 'Can I withdraw my principal anytime?',
    a6: 'Principal exits now depend on position type. Flexible USDT principal and flexible RWA principal use the dedicated principal-withdraw actions. Locked principal can be withdrawn after maturity. Only pre-maturity locked USDT uses Emergency Withdrawal, where the refundable amount is proportional to completed lock days, paid back in USDT, and remains irreversible for that selected position.',
    q7: 'What do node levels do?',
    a7: 'Node levels are L1鈥揕9. Higher levels earn a higher USDT referral percentage when referred users stake, and L4+ can also join protocol revenue sharing. Referral rewards are calculated on the referred user鈥檚 stake amount, not on their daily static yield.',
    q8: 'How do I upgrade my node level?',
    a8: 'Node level upgrades are checked from your current personal stake, team stake, and structure. The exact live thresholds are shown on the Nodes & Referrals page and are applied automatically by the system; no manual application is needed.',
    q9: 'How do I invite friends?',
    a9: 'Find your wallet address on the Nodes & Referral page and share it with friends. When they stake for the first time, they enter your address in the \'Referral Address\' field 鈥?the relationship is automatically and permanently bound. Note: cannot be changed once bound.',
    q10: 'Are referral rewards in USDT or RWA?',
    a10: 'Dynamic rewards (referral rewards) are paid in USDT, not RWA. They are triggered when referred users stake, based on that stake amount and node-level compression rules, then credited to your claimable USDT balance.',
    q11: 'Has the contract been audited?',
    a11: 'Yes. RWA Protocol smart contracts have been audited by both SlowMist and CertiK. Full audit reports are publicly available on the Security & Audit page. We commit to new audits before every major upgrade.',
    q12: 'Are my funds safe?',
    a12: '鈿狅笍 Important: RWA Protocol is an experimental DeFi product with inherent risks: 鈶?Smart contract vulnerabilities (audited but not 100% guaranteed); 鈶?Token price volatility; 鈶?Protocol parameter changes. Only invest what you can afford to lose. Past performance does not guarantee future results.',
    q13: 'What if wallet connection fails?',
    a13: 'Try in order: 鈶?Confirm wallet is on BSC Mainnet (Chain ID: 56); 鈶?Refresh page and reconnect; 鈶?Clear browser cache; 鈶?Update wallet app to latest version; 鈶?On mobile, try opening this page in OKX or Binance App\'s built-in browser.',
    q14: 'What if my transaction stays pending?',
    a14: 'This may happen during BSC network congestion. Solutions: 鈶?Wait 10鈥?0 minutes 鈥?usually auto-confirms; 鈶?In wallet, find the transaction and \'Speed Up\' (increase gas); 鈶?If pending over 1 hour, check status on BSCScan; 鈶?When contacting support, provide your TX Hash.',
    q15: 'What if my rewards didn\'t arrive?',
    a15: 'Daily rewards settle at UTC 00:00 with up to 2-hour delay. Check: 鈶?Dashboard \'Recent Activity\' for reward records; 鈶?Confirm staking status is normal (emergency withdrawal not triggered); 鈶?If not arrived after 24 hours, contact community support via Telegram or Discord with your wallet address.',
    quickLinks: 'Quick Links',
